1
00:00:09,625 --> 00:00:14,667
这都是你的错 你知道的吧
This is your fault. You realize that. Don't you?

2
00:00:16,125 --> 00:00:18,917
我只是想让人民团结起来
All I wanted was to bring people together.

3
00:00:19,292 --> 00:00:22,083
让他们有更好的生活
To give them a chance at a better life.

4
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:24,125
但你
But you-

5
00:00:24,417 --> 00:00:26,917
我?我只是个受害者
Me? I am a victim.

6
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,583
我承认我被骗了 被利用了!
I'll admit I was duped. Used!

7
00:00:30,625 --> 00:00:35,833
尽管我说不上怎么清自 但至少我不是杀人犯
And although my hands may not be clean, at least I am not a murderer.

8
00:00:40,083 --> 00:00:42,167
他没有杀任何人
He didn't kill anybody.

9
00:00:42,792 --> 00:00:47,250
我可不想被你这种与令我们分崩离析的罪魁祸首
And I am not gonna stand here and be lectured by some snake with a mustache

10
00:00:47,292 --> 00:00:49,958
狼狈为奸的虫豸教育
who helped that man tear us all apart!

11
00:00:51,708 --> 00:00:53,750
好嘛
Yes, well...

12
00:00:54,625 --> 00:00:58,958
我猜我们现在都被困一块了
I suppose we're all stuck in it together now.

13
00:01:01,542 --> 00:01:03,583
你自己如此罢了
Just speak for yourself.

14
00:01:03,625 --> 00:01:05,500
我自有门道
I know the right people.

15
00:01:05,542 --> 00:01:08,208
我相信惠斯利已经与法律团队沟通过
I'm sure Whitley has reached out to my legal team

16
00:01:08,250 --> 00:01:10,833
在你们还唧唧歪歪时就把我弄出一
and will have me out of here before you can say-

17
00:01:10,875 --> 00:01:12,292
闭嘴
Shut up.

18
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:28,208
你知道你们已经抓到我了吧
You do realize you've already caught me.

19
00:01:41,875 --> 00:01:44,875
我讨厌无能为力的感觉
I hate not being able to do anything.

20
00:01:46,458 --> 00:01:48,500
我们还是能有作为的
We can do something.

21
00:01:50,792 --> 00:01:53,792
我们能杀了那个把我们关进来的人
We can kill the man who put us here.

22
00:01:54,833 --> 00:01:57,167
由于埃隆伍德将军仍未发表任何声明
With still no word from General Ironwood,

23
00:01:57,208 --> 00:02:02,125
曼特市民为军事人员的突然撤离害怕且困惑
Mantle citizens are frightened and perplexed by the sudden withdrawal of mitary personnel,

24
00:02:02,167 --> 00:02:05,125
尤其是大量的戮兽还游曳在王国外
especially given the massive Grimm horde outside the kingdom.

25
00:02:05,167 --> 00:02:10,500
我从未见过这般场景 这确实像世界末日
live never seen anything quite like this.It truly feels like the end of days.

26
00:02:10,542 --> 00:02:15,250
但擎天之眼将继续至死不渝的为公众更新动态-
But the Atlas Eye is committed to updating the public,until our dying-

27
00:02:15,708 --> 00:02:16,875
喂等等
Hey, wait!

28
00:02:19,125 --> 00:02:23,542
曼特市民们! 埃隆伍德将军拋弃了你们
Citizens of Mantle! General Ironwood has abandoned you,

29
00:02:23,708 --> 00:02:25,708
但我们不会
but we have not.

30
00:02:25,958 --> 00:02:30,417
如果你听得到 带上所有食物和保暖所需物资
If you can hear this, gather any food and supplies you need to stay warm

31
00:02:30,458 --> 00:02:32,208
然后前往曼特巨坑
then head to the Mantle Crater.

32
00:02:32,250 --> 00:02:35,167
戮兽正在突进城市
The Grimm are starting to make their way back into the city,

33
00:02:35,208 --> 00:02:39,000
但只要团结一致 我们就能挺过去
but we can hold the line if we all come together.

34
00:02:39,042 --> 00:02:45,375
若非如此 你们都知道风暴中我们会是什么下场
If we don't, well, you've all seen what's waiting for us out in the storm

35
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:48,958
曼特 该露出獠牙了
It's time to show your teeth Mantle.

36
00:02:57,417 --> 00:03:00,083
可以 其他人可错过了好东西
All right. The others are definitely missing out.

37
00:03:09,042 --> 00:03:11,250
Yang! 别! 不要啊!
Yang! Yang no! No!

38
00:03:37,167 --> 00:03:38,292
只携带必须之物
Only take what you need.

39
00:03:38,542 --> 00:03:41,458
巨坑?你确定那里安全吗?
The crater? Are you sure it's safe out there?

40
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:43,125
我敢肯定 女士
Absolutely ma'am.

41
00:03:53,542 --> 00:03:54,333
小心
Heads up!

42
00:04:06,333 --> 00:04:07,750
比悬浮摩托好多了
Way better than a hover bike.

43
00:04:08,458 --> 00:04:10,750
戮兽已经突进得这么深了?
Have the Grimm already pushed this far in?

44
00:04:11,667 --> 00:04:14,042
不 我想那只是昨晚的残留
No, I think those were more from last night.

45
00:04:14,625 --> 00:04:15,875
不过...
Still...

46
00:04:16,458 --> 00:04:20,083
Ren! 如果Jaune用他的元气奶你 你能把所有人屏蔽吗?
Ren! If Jaune hits you with his Aura Amp, think you can mask everyone?

47
00:04:21,292 --> 00:04:22,542
我可以一试
We can give it a shot,

48
00:04:23,083 --> 00:04:24,958
但穿越曼特路途遥远
but it is a lengthy trip through Mantle.

49
00:04:29,292 --> 00:04:30,917
不 这主意很好
No, no, that's a great idea.

50
00:04:31,292 --> 00:04:34,000
我们可以一路不受戮兽威胁到达巨坑
We'll have a Grimm free journey all the way to the crater.

51
00:04:34,458 --> 00:04:37,750
我们真的得和底下贫民区里的禽兽共住一屋吗?
Do we really got a shack up with those animals down in the slums?

52
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,625
我觉得去擎天更安全
I'd feel a lot safer being up in Atlas.

53
00:04:41,167 --> 00:04:42,958
是啊 我想你会这么觉得
Yeah, I'm sure you would.

54
00:04:43,458 --> 00:04:46,500
但是上面的大人觉得你们不配如此劳烦他们
But the people up top have decided you're not worth the trouble.

55
00:04:47,917 --> 00:04:52,417
而弗纳人反而却愿意全力帮助
The Faunus, on the other hand, have been willing to lend all the help they can.

56
00:04:52,958 --> 00:04:55,458
不管你配不配被帮助
Regardless of whether or not you deserve it.

57
00:04:57,875 --> 00:05:01,375
那 我就...这就收拾东西呗
So, I'll just... I'll go get our things then.

58
00:05:09,542 --> 00:05:11,792
我不想去贫民窟
I don't want to go to the slums.

59
00:05:11,875 --> 00:05:12,333
妈
Mother!

60
00:05:12,375 --> 00:05:14,625
埃隆伍德将军说了会带我们去擎天
General Ironwood said we were going to Atlas.

61
00:05:14,667 --> 00:05:16,125
你在做坏榜样
You're setting a bad example!

62
00:05:16,917 --> 00:05:20,083
让群众配合怎么那么难呢
It should not be this hard getting people to just cooperate.

63
00:05:20,125 --> 00:05:22,083
她没必要凶我啊
She didn't need to yell at me.

64
00:05:22,125 --> 00:05:23,792
妈 没事的 没事的
Mother, it's fine. It's fine.

65
00:05:23,833 --> 00:05:27,708
确实 这也是我越来越担心的问题
And yet,it's something I'm becoming increasingly concerned about.

66
00:05:29,167 --> 00:05:33,208
你知道吗 我现在真的不需要你的额外点评
You know I really don't need your additional commentary right now.

67
00:05:34,167 --> 00:05:36,458
你们都有资格不爽
You all have every right to be upset,

68
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,417
尤其是你奥斯卡
especially you Oscar.

69
00:05:39,042 --> 00:05:40,708
我很抱歉离开了你
I'm sorry I left you.

70
00:05:41,583 --> 00:05:43,417
我不是因为你离开而伤心
I'm not upset that you left.

71
00:05:44,208 --> 00:05:45,833
我是不爽你回归
I'm upset you came back.

72
00:05:47,042 --> 00:05:48,750
我才开始感受自我
I started to feel like me.

73
00:05:49,208 --> 00:05:51,292
虽然不再是这一切之前的我了
Not the same me I was before all of this

74
00:05:51,333 --> 00:05:53,833
但这是我所一直想要成为的
but, the me I always wanted to be.

75
00:05:54,667 --> 00:05:58,375
我感到自己真的成为团队的一份子
I felt, like I was actually part the team.

76
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:00,750
我理解
I understand.

77
00:06:01,250 --> 00:06:06,583
但尽管感觉是不像是我与你同在 我却从未离开
But even though it may not have felt like I was with you, I was never truly gone.

78
00:06:07,500 --> 00:06:09,833
你正在掌握我残留的魔力
You're gaining control of my remaining magic,

79
00:06:09,875 --> 00:06:12,875
回忆着我长久的记忆
recollecting my longest held memories.

80
00:06:12,917 --> 00:06:19,250
这意味着我们两个灵魂仍在不可避免的走向同一
Which means our two souls are still on the inevitable path to becoming one.

81
00:06:19,958 --> 00:06:23,208
但我不想这样
But, I don't want that.

82
00:06:24,042 --> 00:06:25,250
我也不想
Neither do I.

83
00:06:28,958 --> 00:06:30,250
嘿 你还好吗
Hey, you good?

84
00:06:30,583 --> 00:06:32,292
只是要专注的对象太多了
It's just a lot to focus on.

85
00:06:32,583 --> 00:06:33,458
Ren你能做到的
You can do it Ren.

86
00:06:33,833 --> 00:06:34,708
我们已经快到-
We're almost to the Crater-

87
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:35,875
我不需要鼓舞
I don't need a pep talk.

88
00:06:36,250 --> 00:06:37,833
我只需要专注
I need to focus.

89
00:06:39,958 --> 00:06:40,792
好吧
Right.

90
00:06:41,792 --> 00:06:44,000
我需要想办法合作
We need to find a way to work together,

91
00:06:44,667 --> 00:06:46,417
不只是我们俩
not just the two of us,

92
00:06:48,958 --> 00:06:50,375
而是所有人
all of us.

93
00:07:05,917 --> 00:07:07,250
好了 过来吧
All right, come on.

94
00:07:13,125 --> 00:07:14,583
还是要感谢你来帮忙
Thanks again for coming.

95
00:07:14,625 --> 00:07:15,625
不用客气
Don't mention it.

96
00:07:15,667 --> 00:07:19,083
罗宾听说了阿米特塔的事后 她就在唠叨个不停
Once Robyn learned about Amity Tower, she wouldn't shut up about it.

97
00:07:19,333 --> 00:07:23,208
不管她在哪 我想她一定希望我们竭尽所能把塔射上去
Wherever she is. 'm sure she would want us doing what we can to get it up in the air

98
00:07:23,250 --> 00:07:25,250
让世界能够再次互相交流
and get the world talking again.

99
00:07:25,500 --> 00:07:28,708
再说了 斐欧娜也让你朋友们替我去干活了
Besides, Fiona's got your friends helping out in my stead.

100
00:07:31,125 --> 00:07:32,250
是啊
Yeah.

101
00:07:34,625 --> 00:07:36,917
你确定这里安全吗?
Are you sure this is safe?

102
00:07:38,583 --> 00:07:41,458
雪靴物流是雪倪尘晶公司的子公司
Snowshoe Shipping is an SDC subsidiary,

103
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:45,708
所以这里所有的无人机都只听令于公司 而不是将军
meaning all the drones here report to the company, not the general.

104
00:07:46,833 --> 00:07:51,375
气动管道让在巨坑中精炼的尘晶能够直接被运上擎天
The pneumatic tubes allow for Dust refined in the crater to be sent straight up to Atlas

105
00:07:52,208 --> 00:07:54,750
我们只需要找到供应军事基地的那一条就好
We just need to find the one for the military base.

106
00:07:55,083 --> 00:07:58,083
擎天有任何一栋楼是不属于你们家族吗?
Are there any buildings in Atlas that your family doesn't own?

107
00:07:58,583 --> 00:08:01,333
别说这些无关的事情
That isn't relevant at the moment.

108
00:08:11,708 --> 00:08:12,333
嘿
Hey.

109
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:17,250
我不喜欢朋友们拳脚相向
I do not like it when friends fight.

110
00:08:18,458 --> 00:08:19,792
我明白
I know.

111
00:08:20,625 --> 00:08:23,667
Yang和我或许在如何拯救曼特城的事上有分歧 但是
Yang and I might not agree on how best to save Mantle but-

112
00:08:23,708 --> 00:08:24,583
不是
No.

113
00:08:25,625 --> 00:08:28,333
我是说温特 还有将军
I mean Winter. The general.

114
00:08:29,083 --> 00:08:30,833
他们原本是我们的朋友
They were our friends.

115
00:08:31,667 --> 00:08:33,750
但他的金牌特工袭击了你
But then the Ace Ops attacked you.

116
00:08:34,292 --> 00:08:40,417
将军也说了会有人因为我而死
And the general, he said people were going to die,because of me.

117
00:08:41,917 --> 00:08:43,417
那都是谎言
That was a lie.

118
00:08:44,125 --> 00:08:46,292
他那么说都是为了让你伤心
And he was only saying it to hurt you.

119
00:08:49,333 --> 00:08:51,792
我原本只是曼特城的守护者
I was the protector of Mantle,

120
00:08:53,000 --> 00:08:56,750
但现在 我成为了责任更大的人
but now, I am much more than that,

121
00:08:58,208 --> 00:09:00,167
可我希望我不是
and I wish I was not.

122
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:04,625
但你还是你啊 Penny
But, you're still you Penny.

123
00:09:05,458 --> 00:09:08,917
通过成为冬之少女 你就已经在保护曼特城了
By becoming the Winter Maiden you did protect Mantle.

124
00:09:11,875 --> 00:09:13,083
谢谢你 Ruby
Thank you Ruby.

125
00:09:14,792 --> 00:09:15,917
找到了!
I found it!

126
00:09:17,250 --> 00:09:19,208
我想我们已经没有退路了
I suppose there's no turning back now.

127
00:09:19,458 --> 00:09:24,667
有我们的秘密武器与我的外像力 你们不能更安全了
Between our secret weapon and my semblance, you all couldn't be in better hands.

128
00:09:25,708 --> 00:09:27,417
所以这东西怎么用?
So how do we use this thing?

129
00:09:28,125 --> 00:09:29,417
应该很简单
It should be simple.

130
00:09:30,417 --> 00:09:35,250
只要你躺在管道中然后按下发射
If you lie back in the tube and press launch-

131
00:09:42,708 --> 00:09:46,708
不 克里姆森 我需要你和你的团队到11区去
No Crimson, I need you and your team over in Sector 11.

132
00:09:47,000 --> 00:09:49,250
曼特警方在帮我们撤离医院
Mantle police are helping us clear the hospital,

133
00:09:49,292 --> 00:09:50,792
但他们也需要援助
but they're going to need backup.

134
00:09:53,625 --> 00:09:56,875
小斐 你做的很好 罗宾会为你骄傲的
You're doing great Fi.Robyn would be proud.

135
00:09:57,208 --> 00:10:01,125
我觉得这是你的工作 毕竟你在新闻里那么大肆宣扬了一番
I feel like you should be doing this after flexing on the news like that.

136
00:10:02,208 --> 00:10:04,375
不然我要怎么让大家知道呢?
How else was I supposed to get the word out?

137
00:10:04,625 --> 00:10:06,917
而且看起来也有效果
Besides it seems to be working.

138
00:10:09,125 --> 00:10:10,875
这一组人是从哪来的?
Where's this group coming in from?

139
00:10:10,917 --> 00:10:12,917
这是7区的市民
That would be Sector 7.

140
00:10:13,625 --> 00:10:16,417
你已经疏散7区了?太棒了!
You cleared 7 already? That's great!

141
00:10:17,250 --> 00:10:21,875
说实话 我本来还担心在没有队友的情况下你们状态如何
To be honest, I wasn't sure how you'd be doing without all of your teammates.

142
00:10:23,167 --> 00:10:25,625
如你所见 我们状态很好
Well, as you can see we're doing just fine.

143
00:10:26,458 --> 00:10:28,167
你要把大家安置到哪?
But where are you putting everyone?

144
00:10:30,708 --> 00:10:34,417
我们在努力将大部分人安顿到房屋或避难所里
We're working to get most of them settled in houses or other shelters.

145
00:10:34,708 --> 00:10:36,792
社区有好多人也在尝试
A large portion of the community is also trying

146
00:10:36,833 --> 00:10:39,500
将旧矿井整理到能够居住的状态
to get old mine shafts into a livable condition.

147
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,292
我们需要保证很多人的温饱
We've got a lot of people to keep warm.

148
00:10:43,375 --> 00:10:46,750
洗劫雪倪尘晶公司的精炼厂是我们获取尘晶最好的渠道
Looting the SDC refineries is our best source of dust.

149
00:10:47,292 --> 00:10:50,625
好消息是没有人会在末日时被抓进局子
Fortunately no one's getting arrested during the apocalypse.

150
00:10:51,417 --> 00:10:55,292
只是知道戮兽在周围徘徊这件事让人很不安心
Just knowing those Grimm are circling out there doesn't feel great.

151
00:10:56,042 --> 00:10:57,417
它们在等什么?
What are they waiting for?

152
00:10:58,458 --> 00:11:01,583
小斐! 他们又开始打架了
Fi! We got another fight breaking out.

153
00:11:01,958 --> 00:11:06,125
真是的 谢谢大叔 我们会去解决的
Crap. Thanks uncle. We'll handle it.

154
00:11:06,542 --> 00:11:10,208
我会去解决的 你要操心的已经够多了
I'll handle it. You've got enough to worry about.

155
00:11:12,375 --> 00:11:14,250
斐欧娜?这里还是克里姆森
Fiona? Crimson again.

156
00:11:14,292 --> 00:11:17,208
我们监测到一组数量不少的戮兽群在从东面靠近
We spotted a decent sized group of Grimm moving in from the east.

157
00:11:17,250 --> 00:11:18,875
这里平民太多了我们无法攻击
Can't take them with all these civies.

158
00:11:18,917 --> 00:11:20,583
啊怎么这么多麻烦事
Oh, for crying out loud.

159
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:24,917
他说东边是吗?
Did he say east?

160
00:11:36,583 --> 00:11:37,333
准备好了?
Ready?

161
00:11:38,750 --> 00:11:39,583
就是现在
Now.

162
00:11:56,042 --> 00:11:56,833
唔哇!
Woah!

163
00:12:02,458 --> 00:12:05,792
好了斐欧娜 又解决一个问题
Okay Fiona. That's one more problem taken care of.

164
00:12:06,042 --> 00:12:09,042
很好 因为我们收到报告 西面来了更多戮兽
Good, cause we're getting reports of more Grimm coming in from the West.

165
00:12:09,333 --> 00:12:11,500
那边的猎人真的非常需要支援
The Huntsmen there could really use some backup.

166
00:12:13,458 --> 00:12:15,292
好的 我们马上过去
Okay. We're on our way.

167
00:12:16,083 --> 00:12:17,583
都是负面情绪
It's all the negativity.

168
00:12:18,125 --> 00:12:19,625
塞伦的军队没有什么动作
Salem's forces aren't moving in,

169
